# File size limit

- Do not add code that makes any project source file in `src/`, `src-tauri/src/`, or `tests/` exceed **1500 lines**.
- If a change would go over 1500 lines, extract a cohesive module first, then make the change.
- Do not edit or import `*.backup` files (including `src/js/app.js.backup`).
- Ignore `node_modules`, `.opencode`, and `.cursor-backup` when counting.

```javascript
// BAD — keep growing app.js
class App {
    // 1600+ lines of mixed settings / TTS / live / library logic
}

// GOOD — mix focused modules onto App.prototype
import { appSettingsMethods } from './app-settings.js';
Object.assign(App.prototype, appSettingsMethods);
```
